        title: "Preventive Maintenance",
        text: "Central Michigan winters are real—cold that tightens springs, moisture that corrodes hardware, and freeze-thaw cycles that wear on every moving part. An annual tune-up before the season turns keeps your entire system running reliably and catches problems while they're still inexpensive. Available throughout the service area, residential and agricultural.",
